IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CONSTRUCTS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN.
   05 CUST-AGE        PIC 9(3).
      88 IS-MINOR     VALUE 0 THRU 17.
   05 ACCT-TYPE       PIC X.
      88 ACCT-SAVINGS VALUE 'S'.
      88 ACCT-PREMIUM VALUE 'P' 'G'.
   05 BALANCE         PIC S9(7)V99.
   05 RISK-CODE       PIC X(2).
   05 DAYS-LATE       PIC 9(3).
01 WS-OUT.
   05 INT-RATE        PIC 9V999 VALUE 0.
   05 FEE-AMT         PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
   05 RISK-BAND       PIC X VALUE SPACE.
   05 PENALTY         PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
   05 REVIEW-FLAG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
      88 NEEDS-REVIEW VALUE 'Y'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN
    PERFORM NESTED-IF
    PERFORM ELSE-CHAIN
    PERFORM EVAL-TRUE
    PERFORM EVAL-SUBJ
    PERFORM COND-NAMES
    PERFORM ABBREV
    PERFORM OTHER-STMTS
    DISPLAY "INT-RATE=" INT-RATE
    STOP RUN.
NESTED-IF.
    IF ACCT-TYPE = 'S'
        IF BALANCE >= 10000
            MOVE 0.045 TO INT-RATE
        ELSE
            MOVE 0.030 TO INT-RATE
        END-IF
    END-IF.
ELSE-CHAIN.
    IF DAYS-LATE > 90
        MOVE 'H' TO RISK-BAND
    ELSE
        IF DAYS-LATE > 30
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-BAND
        ELSE
            MOVE 'L' TO RISK-BAND
        END-IF
    END-IF.
EVAL-TRUE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN ACCT-TYPE = 'S' AND BALANCE >= 10000
            MOVE 0.045 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN ACCT-TYPE = 'S'
            MOVE 0.030 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.010 TO INT-RATE
    END-EVALUATE.
EVAL-SUBJ.
    EVALUATE DAYS-LATE ALSO ACCT-TYPE
        WHEN 0 THRU 10 ALSO ANY
            MOVE 0 TO PENALTY
        WHEN 11 THRU 30 ALSO 'S'
        WHEN 11 THRU 30 ALSO 'P'
            COMPUTE PENALTY = BALANCE * 0.01
        WHEN OTHER
            ADD 25 TO PENALTY
    END-EVALUATE.
COND-NAMES.
    IF IS-MINOR AND NOT ACCT-PREMIUM
        SET NEEDS-REVIEW TO TRUE
    END-IF.
ABBREV.
    IF CUST-AGE > 17 AND < 65 AND RISK-CODE = 'A1' OR 'A2'
        MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
    END-IF
    IF BALANCE NOT < 500 AND BALANCE IS GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 100
        MOVE 5 TO FEE-AMT
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO FEE-AMT
    END-IF.
OTHER-STMTS.
    IF BALANCE IS NEGATIVE
        CALL 'AUDITLOG' USING WS-IN
            ON EXCEPTION CONTINUE
        END-CALL
        GO TO OTHER-EXIT
    END-IF
    IF RISK-CODE IS NOT NUMERIC
        PERFORM ABBREV
    END-IF.
OTHER-EXIT.
    EXIT.
